;; Which environment variables awai-arb needs and where each is fetched from.
;; References only -- never a value, not even encrypted (ADR-2609241200 decision 10).
;; On the host: kbb --backend sci scripts/hermes-profile-repo.cljk secrets awai-arb
;; (com-junkawasaki/root) writes ~/.hermes/profiles/awai-arb/.env, mode 600.
;; The kagi item awai-arb/resend is added by the owner (value on stdin to
;; `kagi add awai-arb/resend --category api-credential`); until then `secrets`
;; refuses and leaves .env as it is.
{:env {"RESEND_API_KEY" {:kagi "awai-arb/resend"}}}
